Subject: [PATCH 2/3] zed: SVD peripheral registers as a Peripherals variables
 scope

- src/zed/svd.ts: CMSIS-SVD parser (derivedFrom, dim arrays, clusters,
  property inheritance, bitRange/lsb-msb fields, enumeratedValues, readAction)
- src/zed/peripherals.ts: lazy, grouped memory reads cached per stop;
  setVariable writes registers and fields (read-modify-write, enum names)
- adapter.ts: load svdFile, add the scope, route variables/setVariable,
  invalidate on run/step/REPL commands

